copies within the Platform itself. This licence does not purport to revoke that
ability, which AP Solutions does not control, and exercising it within the limits
the Platform imposes is not a breach of this licence.

Beyond that, nothing is granted. In particular, and without the existence of such
a copy authorising it, everything set out in section 2 remains prohibited:
modifying the code, creating derivative works, using it or incorporating it into
any other program, distributing it outside the Platform, publishing your own
builds and offering it to third parties in any form.

AP Solutions does not accept third-party code contributions and will reject those
it receives. If any person submits code, suggestions or comments by any means and
AP Solutions decides to incorporate them, that person thereby grants AP Solutions
the right to use them without limit, without consideration and without any
attribution obligation, and represents that they are entitled to do so.

6. NO WARRANTY

The Program is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranty of any kind,
express or implied, including without limitation warranties of merchantability,
fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy and non-infringement.

AP Solutions does not warrant that the Program will operate uninterrupted or
error-free, nor that the results it produces —title identification, segment
