7. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, AP Solutions shall not be
liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages, nor for lost
profits, loss of data or business interruption, arising from the use or inability
to use the Program, even if advised of the possibility.

Given that the Program is supplied free of charge, AP Solutions' total liability
on any ground is limited to zero euros (€0).

Nothing in this licence excludes or limits liability that cannot lawfully be
